### 0. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5056/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 1. Login to get a token
POST http://localhost:5056/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testetesting2@email.com",
  "password": "emailpassword"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
    client.log("Token captured successfully!");
%}

### 2. Test Access (Should be 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5056/api/auth/test
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Create an Expense (Should be 200 OK)
POST http://localhost:5056/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "expenseName": "Automated Test Expense",
  "amount": 10.99,
  "date": "2024-06-08"
}

### 4. Try Accessing WITHOUT Token (Should be 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:5056/expense